      "Language": "ger",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "With the increased use of the internal mammary artery for coronary artery bypass surgery, new complications are seen. This report describes the twelfth case of a coronary-subclavian steal syndrome. It summarizes all previously reported cases and makes some recommendations in order to avoid and treat this condition."},
